WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.671
♪♪

00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:07.040
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:10.609
-[As Donald Trump]
Thank me. Thank me.

00:00:10.609 --> 00:00:13.513
Welcome back to
"Impeachment After Dark Live,"

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:15.781
the only TV show
that's being sued

00:00:15.781 --> 00:00:19.118
by six federal judges
and all 12 Vanderpumps.

00:00:19.118 --> 00:00:20.519
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.519 --> 00:00:21.954
it's fantastic, folks.

00:00:21.954 --> 00:00:24.090
Now, I cancelled
my press conference today

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:26.760
so I could be here to recap
the deranged details

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:28.260
of the latest Democrat hoax.

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:30.330
But, first, I'm very excited
about this, folks.

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:32.665
Very excited.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:35.902
With the impeachment hearings
heating up, I had to flee --

00:00:35.902 --> 00:00:39.138
sorry -- fly to England.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.138 --> 00:00:43.309
Which means we're coming to you
live from the "Uk."

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:49.181
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.181 --> 00:00:51.384
Now, it turns out,
I love it in the Uk, folks.

00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:52.718
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.718 --> 00:00:55.088
Everything here is opposite,
which means there is --

00:00:55.088 --> 00:00:57.023
This is a football.
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:57.023 --> 00:00:58.591
These are chips.

00:00:58.591 --> 00:01:00.994
And this is Rudy Giuliani.
Just kidding.

00:01:00.994 --> 00:01:02.562
[ Laughter ]
Just kidding.

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:05.064
I know that's the Pope.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.064 --> 00:01:07.433
But, wait, just when you thought
it couldn't get any better,

00:01:07.433 --> 00:01:09.669
I have a very special
guest bartender tonight.

00:01:09.669 --> 00:01:11.337
He's my brother
from another mother,

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:13.372
my blond from across the Pond.

00:01:13.372 --> 00:01:15.808
Give it up for Prime Minister
Boris Johnson, everybody.

00:01:15.808 --> 00:01:17.109
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:17.109 --> 00:01:18.377
-[As Boris Johnson] It's
a pleasure to be here, Donald.

00:01:18.377 --> 00:01:19.913
I mean, look at us.

00:01:19.913 --> 00:01:22.414
We're like a before and after
photo,

00:01:22.414 --> 00:01:23.917
but we're both the before.

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:25.484
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.484 --> 00:01:26.919
-But, alright,
let's get it to it, folks.

00:01:26.919 --> 00:01:29.155
It's time for
the boring yawnfest

00:01:29.155 --> 00:01:32.825
of the impeachment hearings,
led by a man who is 90% pants --

00:01:32.825 --> 00:01:35.694
Jerry Nadler.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.694 --> 00:01:39.298
And talk about all the snooze,
all the committee did today was

00:01:39.298 --> 00:01:40.600
throw around big words

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.201
without telling you
what they mean.

00:01:42.201 --> 00:01:43.836
Or at least,
what I want them to mean.

00:01:43.836 --> 00:01:45.438
Take a look.
-He defines "bribery"

00:01:45.438 --> 00:01:50.009
as the crime of giving or taking
rewards for bad practices.

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:53.379
-It might not fit
today's definition of bribery,

00:01:53.379 --> 00:01:56.983
but it would fit the definition
back in the 18th century.

00:01:56.983 --> 00:01:58.717
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.717 --> 00:02:01.154
-Very confusing.
Very, very confusing.

00:02:01.154 --> 00:02:03.856
Almost nasty.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.856 --> 00:02:06.091
Very confusing, almost nasty.

00:02:06.091 --> 00:02:07.694
Let me just explain to you

00:02:07.694 --> 00:02:09.495
the most important word
in the hearings,

00:02:09.495 --> 00:02:11.363
and my least favorite
Harry Potter spell --

00:02:11.363 --> 00:02:12.865
"quid pro quo."

00:02:12.865 --> 00:02:14.700
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:15.935
Let's break it down.

00:02:15.935 --> 00:02:18.204
"Quid" as in,
"Quid asking about it."

00:02:18.204 --> 00:02:19.539
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.539 --> 00:02:21.608
"Pro" as in,
"It's pro-ably nothing."

00:02:21.608 --> 00:02:22.708
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.708 --> 00:02:24.710
And "quo" as in,
"Don't quote me on this,

00:02:24.710 --> 00:02:26.078
but if you give us
dirt on Biden,

00:02:26.078 --> 00:02:28.247
we will give you $400 million."

00:02:28.247 --> 00:02:29.982
There -- "Quid pro quo."

00:02:29.982 --> 00:02:32.352
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:37.089 --> 00:02:40.026
Now, unfortunately, not everyone
agrees with my definition.

00:02:40.026 --> 00:02:42.361
And things got a little dicey
for the Donald

00:02:42.361 --> 00:02:44.396
when this one law professor
testified.

00:02:44.396 --> 00:02:45.765
Check this out.

00:02:45.765 --> 00:02:47.800
-Did President Trump commit

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:52.939
the impeachable high crime and
misdemeanor of abuse of power?

00:02:52.939 --> 00:02:56.008
-The president did commit
an impeachable abuse of office.

00:02:56.008 --> 00:02:59.712
-Ooh, I'm gonna cyberbully
that nerd so hard.

00:02:59.712 --> 00:03:01.480
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:03.649
Watch out, Professor Plum,

00:03:03.649 --> 00:03:06.519
'cause it's gonna be Donald
trump in the bathroom

00:03:06.519 --> 00:03:07.920
with the Twitter.

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:09.722
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.722 --> 00:03:11.924
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:11.924 --> 00:03:15.694
Well, that's
all the time we have.

00:03:15.694 --> 00:03:17.496
Boris, any last thoughts?

00:03:17.496 --> 00:03:19.032
-None at all, Donald.

00:03:19.032 --> 00:03:21.567
I suppose what happens next
is a mystery,

00:03:21.567 --> 00:03:25.071
sort of like how I was raised
by just my mother,

00:03:25.071 --> 00:03:27.406
who gave me this gold locket.

00:03:27.406 --> 00:03:29.575
-Oh, my gosh.

00:03:29.575 --> 00:03:32.578
You're not gonna believe this,

00:03:32.578 --> 00:03:35.481
but I was raised
by just my nanny

00:03:35.481 --> 00:03:38.685
and she gave me
this gold locket.

00:03:38.685 --> 00:03:40.753
[ Laughter ]

00:03:40.753 --> 00:03:43.923
-We've been parent-tapped.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:43.923 --> 00:03:46.125
-This is huge, folks.
We've got to look into this.

00:03:46.125 --> 00:03:47.526
But, first, [Normal voice] "The
Tonight Show"

00:03:47.526 --> 00:03:49.161
starts right now.
Let's do this!

00:03:49.161 --> 00:03:51.997
Let's start the show. Come on!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:51.997 --> 00:03:55.167
-From 30 Rockefeller Plaza,
here in New York City,

00:03:55.167 --> 00:03:58.104
it's "The Tonight Show
Starring Jimmy Fallon"!

00:03:58.104 --> 00:04:05.210
And now, here's
your host, Jimmy Fallon!

00:04:05.210 --> 00:04:06.312
-♪ Hey, hey, hey ♪

00:04:06.312 --> 00:04:07.980
♪ Hey, hey, hey, hey ♪

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:14.954
-♪ Hey, hey, hey, hey-ey-ey ♪

00:04:14.954 --> 00:04:17.223
♪♪

